-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cThis is the last train. And you are its only passenger.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the world became overrun by the undead.<br>You boarded the final subway still in operation, bound for a single destination: <strong>City Hall</strong>, where your family might still be waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this train isn\u2019t just your escape\u2014it\u2019s a gauntlet. At every station, you\u2019ll face ravenous hordes of zombies. Only by activating the fuse at each stop within the time limit can you move on. Fail\u2026 and a brutal fight for survival awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The DeadLine</strong> is a first-person survival FPS set in a zombie apocalypse,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > where every station brings new tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face a relentless clock, grow stronger with roguelike upgrades, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and immerse yourself in addictive, high-stakes gunplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinctive Weapon System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>Normal</strong>, <strong>Epic</strong>, and <strong>Legendary</strong> firearms\u2014each delivering a perfect blend of realism and fun.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sh